### Health checks — mapped directly in Program.cs (P5.4), not their own
### Endpoints/*.cs file. Public, no auth. The MS-documented split for
### container orchestrators that probe readiness and liveness differently.

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7105

### Readiness — every check, including the database (AddDbContextCheck)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Liveness — only "live"-tagged checks, no dependencies (stop the DB
### container first to see /health go unhealthy while /alive stays healthy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alive
